{"id":"b2-u08","level":"b2","order":8,"title":{"en":"Hobbies","fr":"Les loisirs","es":"Pasatiempos","ar":"الهوايات"},"tip":{"en":"Say 'I like to read' or 'I like reading'. Add a frequency word to say how often: always, usually, often, sometimes, never. In English it goes before the verb: 'I often play'.","fr":"Dites « J'aime lire » et ajoutez un mot de fréquence : toujours, d'habitude, souvent, parfois, jamais. En anglais, il se place avant le verbe : « I often play ».","es":"Di «Me gusta leer» y añade una palabra de frecuencia: siempre, normalmente, a menudo, a veces, nunca. En inglés va antes del verbo: «I often play».","ar":"قل «أحب القراءة» وأضف كلمة تدل على التكرار: دائما، عادة، غالبا، أحيانا، أبدا. وفي الإنجليزية تأتي قبل الفعل: «I often play»."},"words":36,"lessons":[{"id":"b2-u08-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"hobby, free time, to like","fr":"passe-temps, temps libre, aimer","es":"el pasatiempo, el tiempo libre, gustar","ar":"هواية، وقت الفراغ، يحب"},"count":11},{"id":"b2-u08-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"to play, football, basketball","fr":"jouer, football, basket","es":"jugar, el fútbol, el baloncesto","ar":"يلعب، كرة القدم، كرة السلة"},"count":10},{"id":"b2-u08-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"running, cycling, sport","fr":"course à pied, vélo, sport","es":"correr, el ciclismo, el deporte","ar":"الجري، ركوب الدراجة، رياضة"},"count":11},{"id":"b2-u08-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"guitar, to sing, to dance","fr":"guitare, chanter, danser","es":"la guitarra, cantar, bailar","ar":"غيتار، يغني، يرقص"},"count":10},{"id":"b2-u08-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"film, to cook, to draw","fr":"film, cuisiner, dessiner","es":"la película, cocinar, dibujar","ar":"فيلم، يطبخ، يرسم"},"count":10},{"id":"b2-u08-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"to travel, video game, photo","fr":"voyager, jeu vidéo, photo","es":"viajar, el videojuego, la foto","ar":"يسافر، لعبة فيديو، صورة"},"count":9},{"id":"b2-u08